  'Filed JOBSEARCH-LLM-RERANK-1 and JOBSEARCH-SOURCES-1 for the code loop, an IDENTITY-BOUND owner card with a probe, roadmap rows JS-1 to JS-9, and finalised the session record.',
  'qnfo-jobsearch 1.2.1 live: /api/ops 8 of 8 ok, hourly runs 10:15 to 11:15 on 2026-10-28; migrations 2026-10-27-jobsearch*.sql applied; deploy-gate green on main.',
